    "summary": "Delete Expenses",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Delete an expense by id.\n\nDeleting an expense also removes its related accounting journal and attachments.\n\nAn expense cannot be deleted while it is linked to another record (e.g. generated from another entity), already used in an expense-distribution transaction, or dated in a closed financial period.\n\n**Access:** requires the account owner, or staff with *Edit/Delete All Expenses* or *Edit/Delete His Own Expenses* (for their own records).",
    "tags": [
      "Endpoints/Finance/Expenses",
      "Expenses"
    ],
    "parameters": [
